# Netlify / Cloudflare Pages style rewrites (copied to out/ from public/).
# NOTE: Render Static Sites IGNORE this file (they serve it as a static asset).
# On Render, add the same rules under Dashboard → Redirects/Rewrites:
#   Source /rojgar-tips/*      → Destination /rojgar-tips/__static.html  (Rewrite)
#   Source /blogs/*            → Destination /blogs/__static.html        (Rewrite)
#   Source /career-advice/*    → Destination /career-advice/__static.html (Rewrite)
# Until those dashboard rules exist, `app/not-found.tsx` recovers tip URLs
# when the host falls back to 404.html.
#
# 200 = rewrite (URL stays the same in the browser).

/rojgar-tips/*     /rojgar-tips/__static.html     200
/blogs/*           /blogs/__static.html           200
/career-advice/*   /career-advice/__static.html   200
